WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Welcome to Sofrito Studio —
Boricua cooking made simple.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Today we're making sofrito,
the base of every Puerto Rican dish.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Start with recao, garlic,
onion, and bell pepper.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Blend until smooth —
that's your flavor foundation.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.000
Heat olive oil in your caldero
and add two spoonfuls.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Listen to that sizzle —
that's flavor building.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Stir for two minutes
until the garlic turns golden.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.000
Now add your rice —
one cup, rinsed and ready.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.000
Stir to coat every grain
in that sofrito goodness.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:41.000
Add broth, cover, and simmer —
dinner in 30 minutes.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:45.000
That's Boricua cooking.
